{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"7801001060020","name":"ルビー","text":"結果、出たんでしょ？","trans":"结果出来了吧？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-3","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ああ……\r\n今、伝えに行こうと思ってた","trans":"嗯……\n我正准备去告诉你","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"7801001060040","name":"ルビー","text":"ダメだったかぁ","trans":"不行吗","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"7801001060050","name":"ルビー","text":"なんか、いけると思ってたんだけどな","trans":"我还以为能行呢","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-7","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……俺もだ","trans":"……我也是","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"7801001060070","name":"ルビー","text":"……ううん\r\n落ち込んでる場合じゃない！","trans":"……不\n现在不是失落的时候！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"7801001060080","name":"ルビー","text":"次のこと考えなきゃ……！","trans":"得考虑下一步了……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"7801001060081","name":"ルビー＆プロデューサー","text":"１秒も無駄な時間なんてない！","trans":"你没有浪费任何1秒","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}